{"version":1,"content":"<p>【罷工 ⚠️】台灣 Micron 晶圓科技公司企業工會（桃園工會）宣布，明日（22 日）發動為期 1 天的警告性罷工。</p><p>工會抗議資方遲遲未針對一次性特別獎金及常態性利潤分享制度提出具體方案，藉此向 Micron 施壓，要求資方在調解會上正面回應訴求，否則將發動更大規模的罷工行動。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T16:01:24.557651+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:46:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:57:42.412943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:57:42.412943+00:00","content_hash":"4681bb16914d8acc35278a802de60fbf2b054fdef2647b025fbe3c007de24863","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}